I added `waitingFor(ref)` to `Outbox`, right after `forBooking`. It filters to the booking's queued or failed notices, which produces a new array, and then sorts that copy with the existing `sortDue` (by `dueAt`, then `id`). The outbox's own list and its notices are not touched, and an unknown reference gives an empty array. I haven't run it or compiled it.
